But `busy` semantics: after `await first`, `busy` is true either way (queue length > 0) ΓÇö the test's failure is only `turnAt(1)`. So tests should settle. Add `await settle()` in tests where needed.

Also in "preserves rapid sequential page turns" I already used `await settle()` after resolving each. Good.

